KONOHAGAKURE — SQUAD ROSTER: TEAM 8

Jonin-sensei: Yuhi, Kurenai (genjutsu specialist)
Genin:
- Hyuga, Hinata — Byakugan; Gentle Fist. Main house lineage.
- Inuzuka, Kiba — partnered with ninken Akamaru; enhanced senses; Fang Over Fang.
- Aburame, Shino — Kikaichu insect host; tracking and sabotage.

Formation notes: A tracking- and reconnaissance-oriented cell. Between Hinata's Byakugan, Kiba and Akamaru's scent tracking, and Shino's insect network, Team 8 excels at search, pursuit, and surveillance missions.

Status: Active (genin).
